an style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed\u00a0<strong data-end=\"157\" data-start=\"94\">Graduation (Bachelor\u2019s Degree) or an equivalent examination</strong>\u00a0from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.4291%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Child Development Project Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.5709%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must possess a\u00a0<strong data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"219\">Bachelor\u2019s Degree from a recognized university</strong>\u00a0and must choose\u00a0<strong data-end=\"310\" data-start=\"286\">one optional subject</strong>\u00a0for the main examination from the following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Home Science</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Psychology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sociology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Labour &amp; Social Welfare</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.4291%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Financial Administrative Officer &amp; Equivalent</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.5709%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a\u00a0<strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"477\">Bachelor\u2019s Degree from a recognized university or its affiliated institution</strong>\u00a0in any one of the following subjects:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"600\">Commerce, Economics, Mathematics, or Statistics.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.4291%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sub-Divisional Protection Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.5709%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must possess a<strong data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"683\">\u00a0Bachelor\u2019s Degree from a recognized university</strong>\u00a0in either\u00a0<strong data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"744\">Psychology or Law</strong>. Additionally, candidates must choose\u00a0<strong data-end=\"832\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"808\">one optional subject</strong>\u00a0for the main examination from:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Psychology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Law</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-stenographer-2026/\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #000000;\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>SSC Stenographer Recruitment 2026</strong></a></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download BPSC 72nd Pre Admit Card 2026\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"124\" data-section-id=\"qb1t95\" data-start=\"71\">Visit the official\u00a0<strong>Bihar BPSC recruitment portal.</strong></li>\n<li data-end=\"194\" data-section-id=\"130t3qj\" data-start=\"125\">Open the <strong>72nd CCE Pre Recruitment 2026</strong>\u00a0section.</li>\n<li data-end=\"264\" data-section-id=\"159utst\" data-start=\"195\">Click on the\u00a0<strong data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"210\">admit card Notice</strong>\u00a0or the latest recruitment update.</li>\n<li data-end=\"343\" data-section-id=\"x4pi6p\" data-start=\"265\">Find the notification related to your\u00a0<strong>recruitment advertisement and open it.</strong></li>\n<li data-end=\"42